# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Novel texts: download them yourself (see data/README.md).
# The ready-made databases (vectors.npy, chunks.json, meta.json) ARE published,
# so that people who cannot build them can still use the examples.
# data/anna_karenina_v2 (modified text, Stepan -> Sami) is published on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/anna_karenina/*.txt

# The glossary database is not published: build it yourself (README, section 8.3)
data/terminology/vectors.npy
data/terminology/chunks.json
data/terminology/meta.json

